<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores on the first day of four-day</p>
<p>Sheffield Shield matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>In Sydney - Western Australia 180 for eight (Brad Hogg 59.</p>
<p>New South Wales 126.</p>
<p>In Melbourne - Tasmania 250 for six (David Boon 75, Shaun</p>
<p>Young 50) v Victoria.</p>
